| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `getCounter` (cold) | 6,295 | 6,122 (-173) | 6,058 (-237) | 6,052 (-243) |
| `getCounter` (warm) | 4,295 | 4,122 (-173) | 4,058 (-237) | 4,052 (-243) |
| `getOrderStatus` (cold) | 6,203 | 6,030 (-173) | 5,980 (-223) | 5,974 (-229) |
| `getOrderStatus` (warm) | 4,214 | 4,041 (-173) | 3,971 (-243) | 3,965 (-249) |
| `getOrderHash` (1 consideration item) | 14,576 | 14,037 (-539) | 13,867 (-709) | 13,631 (-945) |
| `fulfillAdvancedOrder`, reverting mutation | 29,331 | 28,701 (-630) | 28,863 (-468) | 28,418 (-913) |
