| whole test | 14,069,658 | 14,060,012 | 13,972,393 | 13,968,528 |

The flat -173 on every call under D `-O 1` suggests (inference, not traced) that the saving sits in the shared entry and dispatch path. The Solidity reference for comparison (README): `getCounter` 2,677, `getOrderStatus` 2,465, `getOrderHash` 1,736, `fulfillAdvancedOrder` 21,653. The best version closes about 4% of the Fe-to-Solidity gap on `fulfillAdvancedOrder` (968 of 24,898 gas).

